{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 13, "text": "第一件有君臣、父子、夫妇、朋友、昆弟，各守五伦，各尽人道；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1098, "w": 1041, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第一件有君臣、父子、夫妇、朋友、昆弟，各守五伦，各尽人道；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1098, "w": 1041, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 14, "text": "第二件君尽道、臣尽忠、子尽孝、妇尽夫、弟尽兄，各尽其诚；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1167, "w": 1021, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第二件君尽道、臣尽忠、子尽孝、妇尽夫、弟尽兄，各尽其诚；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1167, "w": 1021, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 15, "text": "第三件人家有规敬老、慈幼，勿忘宾礼；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1227, "w": 671, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第三件人家有规敬老、慈幼，勿忘宾礼；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1227, "w": 671, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 16, "text": "第四件处邻里而和乡党，莫使愧心而昧骗；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1295, "w": 732, "h": 45}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第四件处邻里而和乡党，莫使愧心而昧骗；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1295, "w": 732, "h": 45}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 17, "text": "第五件须要众人而合一心，休藏口口刀剑；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1360, "w": 736, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第五件须要众人而合一心，休藏口口刀剑；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1360, "w": 736, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 18, "text": "第六件山树林木地口口朴，人丁兴旺，求宽怀以待人；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1424, "w": 917, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第六件山树林木地口口朴，人丁兴旺，求宽怀以待人；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1424, "w": 917, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 19, "text": "第七件善良者宽，刑凶暴者逞威，口振家风，天必从之；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1489, "w": 941, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第七件善良者宽，刑凶暴者逞威，口振家风，天必从之；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1489, "w": 941, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 20, "text": "第八件富贵贫贱、红白会期、口口助老，邻里相帮，一境和悦；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1553, "w": 1041, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第八件富贵贫贱、红白会期、口口助老，邻里相帮，一境和悦；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1553, "w": 1041, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 21, "text": "第九件世有刚烈者因小事而威逼大事，各方劝化，谨戒奢华；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1617, "w": 1041, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第九件世有刚烈者因小事而威逼大事，各方劝化，谨戒奢华；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1617, "w": 1041, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 22, "text": "第十件世为匪窃得物投宿，凡我境内之人，查实口问，方可借宿；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1682, "w": 1102, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十件世为匪窃得物投宿，凡我境内之人，查实口问，方可借宿；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1682, "w": 1102, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 23, "text": "第十一件有年壮女姿者芶合私奸，此等不法，父母族内伙同治之；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1746, "w": 1122, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十一件有年壮女姿者芶合私奸，此等不法，父母族内伙同治之；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1746, "w": 1122, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 24, "text": "第十二件妇女独行者，乃遇寻花问柳之鄙夫，昧心拐逃，恐后有累，切莫隐", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1810, "w": 1299, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十二件妇女独行者，乃遇寻花问柳之鄙夫，昧心拐逃，恐后有累，切莫隐", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1810, "w": 1299, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 25, "text": "匿，不可招留；", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1878, "w": 245, "h": 46}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "匿，不可招留；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 1878, "w": 245, "h": 46}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 26, "text": "第十三件世有不法之徒，昼夜游赌，刁害民家之子弟，各人警戒，勿喧哗；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1943, "w": 1242, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十三件世有不法之徒，昼夜游赌，刁害民家之子弟，各人警戒，勿喧哗；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 1943, "w": 1242, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 27, "text": "第十四件世有游手好闲，日夜共饕餐，借酒逞凶，此失其大节，切莫以行以留；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2008, "w": 1286, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十四件世有游手好闲，日夜共饕餐，借酒逞凶，此失其大节，切莫以行以留；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2008, "w": 1286, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 28, "text": "第十五件各户种植之谷物各管，不可私窃，勿为狗盗；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2072, "w": 921, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十五件各户种植之谷物各管，不可私窃，勿为狗盗；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2072, "w": 921, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 29, "text": "第十六件如有土地凭证，凭中典当或卖，不可妄害生讼，枉害受罚；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2136, "w": 1146, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十六件如有土地凭证，凭中典当或卖，不可妄害生讼，枉害受罚；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2136, "w": 1146, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 30, "text": "第十七件假害生事，丢赃诈骗，盗窃牛马家财，内外查实，连窝同办，不恕；", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2201, "w": 1266, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "第十七件假害生事，丢赃诈骗，盗窃牛马家财，内外查实，连窝同办，不恕；", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2201, "w": 1266, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 31, "text": "第十八件各户多种五谷、瓜果、蔬菜，务使肥己利家；", "bbox_px": {"x": 257, "y": 2265, "w": 897, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第十八件各户多种五谷、瓜果、蔬菜，务使肥己利家；", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 257, "y": 2265, "w": 897, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 32, "text": "第十九件世有做贼之人甚多，每思牵牛拉马口款之家口落通口口。", "bbox_px": {"x": 257, "y": 2329, "w": 1146, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "第十九件世有做贼之人甚多，每思牵牛拉马口款之家口落通口口。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 257, "y": 2329, "w": 1146, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 33, "text": "道光二十八年立。", "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2394, "w": 310, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "道光二十八年立。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 253, "y": 2394, "w": 310, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 34, "text": "丫坡煤洞有碍田户，断令封闭，永无不法。诚恐附近居民籍称不知，仍在该处", "bbox_px": {"x": 261, "y": 2458, "w": 1291, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "丫坡煤洞有碍田户，断令封闭，永无不法。诚恐附近居民籍称不知，仍在该处", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 261, "y": 2458, "w": 1291, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 498, "line_no": 35, "text": "强行开采，亦未可定。合行出示严禁，为此示仰附近凡苗人等知悉：自示以后，毋", "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2523, "w": 1383, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "强行开采，亦未可定。合行出示严禁，为此示仰附近凡苗人等知悉：自示以后，毋", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 173, "y": 2523, "w": 1383, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
